window.products.push({"id":651006,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Bags Rolls for Food Saver, GAVASTO Biodegradable Vacuum Sealer Bags for Food, Seal a Meal Bags, Commercial Grade, BPA/BPS Free, Great fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719WscBhDpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIVERSAL DESIGN: compatible with any type of vacuum sealing machine and promise with better sealing effect. HEALTHIER VACUUM BAG: Our vacuum bag is made of raw materials such as sugarcane granules and corn starch , which are healthier for the human body. Compared with ordinary vacuum bags made of polyamide and polyethylene, it is still slightly not friendly to the human body. ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY SEALING BAGS: We designed and launched ecologically friendly and biodegradable sealing bags, which can significantly reduce the damage to natural animals and plants. When we see the animals in the sea injured by plastic pollution, we feel heartbroken. USE AT EASE: It can be safely used in a non-microbial environment and will not be degraded due to the storage of vegetables and meat. The bags slowly degrade only under the action of microorganisms in the soil and seawater. Generally, it takes about 6-8 months to degrade in the ground, 2-3 months to degrade in the seawater, and about 200 years to degrade compared with ordinary degradable bags, which are very friendly to us humans and other animals. EXCELLENT AFTER-SALES SERVICE: We provide a 6-month worry-free return and all-weather response service. In addition, we suggest that although our vacuum bag can be degraded, we suggest that you do not discard the used bag at will for the sake of a beautiful environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719WscBhDpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAVASTO","source_asin":"B0BDRFDTVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRFDTVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRFDTVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
