window.products.push({"id":651077,"name":"Fashionista Cookie Cutter Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vbJLeUteL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create fun-to-decorate cookies with this fashion cookie cutter set! This five piece set includes a diamond ring, handbag, shoe, dress, and t-shirt. Perfect for fashionistas everywhere, these shapes will slice through and release from dough easily, bringing ease to the cookie prep process. Constructed of durable tin-plated steel, these cutters have an attractive shine and luster that will be best preserved when hand washed and dried completely after use. Great for cookies, fondant, crafts and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vbJLeUteL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fox Run","source_asin":"B003WPBUZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WPBUZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WPBUZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":651078,"name":"HEART BRIDE AND GROOM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yCCTV3fML._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yCCTV3fML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPLRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPLRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPLRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":651079,"name":"Slow Juicer, AMZCHEF 5-in-1 Multifunctional Slicer shredder, Cold Press Juicer Professional Masticating Juicer, Juice Extractor with Quiet Motor,Juice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nf-AbkN8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍈【5-in-1 Multifunctional Juicer】 This juicer combines 5 functions for all of your daily using all in one machine. You can use it to juice,ice crush,meat grind,shre and slice,especially make ice cream,you don’t need to use knife to cut fruit and vegetables,even don't need to go outside to buy ice cream,but use only our AMZCHEF slow juicer can meet all your demands,which is extremely convenient and better to save time and energy. 🍑【Ultra-Quiet Meat Grinder】AMZCHEF slow juicer is better compared with ordinary juicer.The traditional juicer is as noisy as bombers.But to use our AMZCHEF juicer,the working noise is even less than 60dB,also you can us it as baby food meat grinder, mince meat in the morning and evening without disturbing your partner,baby or old people while they are resting,whcih is extremely quiet. 🍊【Ice Cream&Crush Function】AMZCHEF Cold Press Juicer put hard fruit can squeeze the juice, put the soft fruit can make delicious fruit ice cream. Meanwhile, our manual ice crusher can also freeze soft fruits, and then use the crushed ice function to make fruit smoothies. However, please note that please do not use the juice extraction kit for crushed ice. You need to use the corresponding shredder and slicing accessories to realize the crushed ice function, otherwise the motor will be blocked. 🍍【Higher Juice】AMZCHEF Juicer Machine, the innovative 112rpm slow screw can squeeze up to 90% of nutrient-rich juice,maximizing the nutritional value of fruits/vegetable and reducing oxidation.It can extract various fruits and leafy vegetables such as apples, oranges, wheatgrass.You can imagine how happy it is to drink a glass of nutritious juice with this AMZCHEF slow juicer when summer arrives. It is full of enjoyment. It accompanies with us like our partner through the heat Summer. 🍇【5 Seconds Quick Cleaning】AMZCHEF innovative design and advanced technology change the industry’s hard-to-clean problem, the history of juicer inseparable from the stainless steel strainer,it's time to say goodbye to time-consuming and laborious! Choose AMZCHEF slow juicer, you can even achieve 5 seconds fast rinse with only a small brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nf-AbkN8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amzchef","source_asin":"B096FSPZSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096FSPZSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096FSPZSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":651080,"name":"VJJ AIDEAR 1 Pcs Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser Wall Mounted Toothpaste Dispenser Automatic Toothpaste Squeezer for Washroom Bathroom(Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zvsVU0haL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【Free Your Hands】Hands-Free Toothpaste Holder Is Non-Contact Operation And Free Squeeze To Get Toothpaste, Avoid Direct Touch, Very Hygienic And Convenience. 【Vacuum Tech & Elderly/Kids Friendly】As adopting vacuum pump technology, it allows your kids the ability to squeeze out accurate and good amount of toothpaste each time, without making a mess. It helps us avoid direct touch and prevent from bacteria. It is a more hygienic way to pump out the last drop of your toothpaste, no waste! 【Premium Quality & Art Piece】The Wall Mounted Toothpaste Dispensers Are Made Of Abs Plastic, Non-Toxic And Durable, Smooth To Touch And Exquisite, Safe To Use And Will Not Break Or Fade Easily, Can Provide You A Long-Term Service. 【Easy Installation & Suitable】Support wall-mounted installation, saving space and no drill and hole needed. The back of the toothpaste dispenser is a adhesive and super sticky suction pad, which is very strong and durable. It fits to most standard and normal toothpaste tubes that are smaller than 0.47 inch (1.2 cm). 【TIPS for First Use】When Using This Product For The First Time, It Is Recommended That You Squeeze The Toothpaste Body After Installing The Toothpaste Squeezer, And Then Press The Button Several Times To Remove Air Inside The Toothpaste Dispenser Until Toothpaste Flow，Please Don'T Use The Round Head Toothbrush, It Will Squish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zvsVU0haL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VJJ AIDEAR","source_asin":"B086GZK4GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086GZK4GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086GZK4GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
