window.products.push({"id":651272,"name":"April Roses Eternal Flower-Preserved Rose Flower in Glass Dome for Christmas Anniversary Valentine's Day Mother's Day Birthday Engagement Thanksgiving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N-H4dbGMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIFT YOUR LOVED ONES WITH AN ETERNAL ROSE, MAKE A TRULY LASTING IMPRESSION AS LONG AS THE MEMORY OF RECEIVING IT DOES Everyone appreciates fresh rose flower, it's superior and fascinating, but it begins to fade within few days. Although the sentiment may last forever,the fresh rose flower unfortunately never does. Within days, lush, verdant rose flower tends to wilt and shrivel. So, wouldn't it be nice to own a redrose flower that lasts just as long as the memory of receiving it does? Preserved rose, also known as never withered rose, eternal rose or immortal rose, is a natural rose that has been processed with a special treatment to maintain its peak appearance for years, it provides you or your loved ones with the opportunity to marvel at their exquisiteness each day and night. So gifting your loved ones with an eternal rose seems as more meaningful as it defies time and age and makes them a truly lasting impression of receiving it. Life is too short to wait and hesitate, just brave enough to show your loved ones your respect, sincerity, everlasting love and greetings with our preserved eternal rose, and let them know (I'm sure they know) you will love them forever no matter what happens. Gift Wrap Content Enchanted Eternal Rose in Glass Dome (4.7 X 7.9in) Perfect Gift For Apology, Anniversary, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, Birthday, Engagement, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas, etc. Care & Maintenance 1. No watering or refrigeration; 2. Occasional dedusting with soft brush; 3. Avoid direct sunlight, and use indoor only; 4. Avoid high temperature and high humidity. Worry-free Purchase 30 Days Money Back Guarantee Tag: Eternal Rose, Preserved Flower, Immortal Rose, the Beauty and the Beast, Enchanted Rose in Glass Dome, Forever Rose Gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N-H4dbGMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"April Roses","source_asin":"B098JF84KD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098JF84KD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098JF84KD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
