window.products.push({"id":651435,"name":"Gizoon Queen Bed Frame with Storage Headboard, Metal Platform Bed Frame Strong Steel Slats Support Mattress Foundation, Large Under Storage, No Noise ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811GTQZi23L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Comfortable & Practical Headboard】The retro industrial style platform bed frame with gray upholstered backrest and storage headboard, which is comfortable and functional. Can provide storage for your glasses, mobile phone, books, jewelry and other items while sleeping. The design is simple and beautiful, suitable for any styles of rooms. 【Sturdy & Stable Bed Frame Construction】Gizoon platform bed frame is composed of strong heavy-duty metal support frame and 14 metal slats, center support bar and sturdy support legs provide a more stable and noise-free support base. Holds up to 1000 lbs, no box springs needed. 【Practical Under-Bed Storage】The queen bed frame with headboard has 11’’ high under-bed storage space, which can store bulky suitcases and everyday clothes within easy reach. At the same time, it is convenient for the sweeping robot to clean the bottom of the bed freely, providing extra space while maintaining a clean bedroom environment. 【Noise-Free & Protective Device】Queen size bed frame rubber anti-slip mats can protect your floor from scratches, prevent slipping and eliminate friction noise. The place where each metal strip is combined is pasted with soundproof cotton to isolate noise and provide you with a quiet sleeping environment. Rounded corners at the head and foot of the bed protect you and your family from harm. 【Product Dimensions】Gizoon bed frame queen with upholstered storage headboard has 2 colors: dark gray and light gray; 3 sizes: Full: 81.5'' x 53.9'' x 38.9'', Queen: 86.6'' x 60.2'' x 38.9 '', King: 86.6'' x 75.9'' x 38.9''. It fits up to 12'' thick to match the full/queen/king size mattresses in the market. 【Easy to Assemble】The parcel includes basic bed frame and all parts, including installation of screwdriver. The bed frame structure is simple. The slats is designed with an independent buckle, which can be assembled easily. Each step of the manual is clear and easy to understand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811GTQZi23L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gizoon","source_asin":"B0BTT727LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTT727LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTT727LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
