window.products.push({"id":651459,"name":"Costzon Kids Table and Chair Set, Children Wooden Activity Table w/Storage, Double-Sided Building Block Tabletop, Drawers, 2 Chairs for Preschool, Nur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DKPECiPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-function Activity Table Set: Kids and toddlers can build up blocks with their amazing imagination on the small particle game board side. They can also easily flip over the board to create a flat and smooth tabletop and do some eating, writing, painting and reading. 2 Storage Drawers with Large Capacity: After finishing the block building, you can put them together into the 2 large non-woven fabric drawers under the table with your kids to keep them within reach and play again conveniently. It can also help your kids form a good habit of organizing and keep their room tidy. Safe & Durable Construction: This table and 2 chairs set is made of premium wooden, which is sturdy and durable for long lasting use. The table can hold up to 200 lbs and the chair can hold up to 100 lbs. The table set is non-toxic, odorless and kids-friendly and has passed the ASTM certification. Perfect Gift for the Loved : This kids table set will be a perfect holiday or birthday gift for your kids aged 3-8. It brings your kids a free individual world, helps your kids maintain a good sitting posture and accompanies them through their long-term playing and studying life. The waterproof table top is easy to clean, and the rounded corners will not scratch your child's skin. Easy Assembly & Dimensions: We provide you with a detailed manual in the package to help you assemble this table set effortlessly. Table Dimension: 25.5” x 25.5” x 21”, Chair Dimension: 11” x 12” x 21”. This kids furniture set is perfectly sized for your kids and toddlers to use in the kids room, living room, and kindergarten.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DKPECiPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B09NYBD9V1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NYBD9V1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NYBD9V1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
