window.products.push({"id":651494,"name":"65pcs Mylar Bags for Food Storage With Oxygen Absorbers, 10 Mil 5 Gallon, 1Gallon, 1Quart, 1/2 Pint, Zipper Mylar Bags for Long Term Food Storage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QB886Z8vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food-Grade Materials: Our mylar bags are made from food-grade material that is safe, eco-friendly, durable, and tasteless. These bags have three layers: PET, aluminum foil, and PE. High-Quality: It has an added internal layer of aluminum foil which provides excellent durability, puncture resistance, and prevents light and air permeation to keep your food safe, ensure that you can store your food for a longer period. Premium Oxygen Absorbers: 2500cc Oxygen Absorbers Individually Sealed in a factory vacuum-sealed, Each pack of 10pcs 400cc absorbers comes pre-packaged in a factory vacuum-sealed pouch to reduce product exposure and waste. Resealable Zipper Bag：The zipper design can be used repeatedly, which is convenient for foods that are often eaten. Sealable with a hot iron or heat-sealing machine for long-term food storage. The standing type can simplify the storage of the cabinet. Multi-Purpose: Dehydrates food for storage, including grains, beans, oats, dried fruit, candies, coffee beans, and tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QB886Z8vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHXWELL","source_asin":"B0C68XF3JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68XF3JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68XF3JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
