window.products.push({"id":651605,"name":"American Gift Services Godzilla King of The Monsters 1956 Vintage Movie Poster Art 11x17","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E+2YZRhAL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a wonderful full color reproduction of a vintage movie poster, the classic 1956 horror film, Godzilla King of the Monsters, is a 1956 Japanese American Science fiction Kaiju film. It is a re-edited Americanized version of the film Godzilla, which had previously been shown subtitled in the United States in Japanese community theaters only, and was not known in Europe. For the American production, the original Japanese footage was dubbed into the English language and new footage was shot with actor Raymond Burr. This reproduction print is made with acid free and archival materials right here in the United States. Sized 11 inches by 17 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E+2YZRhAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Gift Services","source_asin":"B00F5BNPHE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F5BNPHE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F5BNPHE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
