window.products.push({"id":651618,"name":"Geanli Over Sink Dish Drying Rack, Adjustable Length (33''-41'') Dish Drying Rack, Stainless Steel Dish Rack Over The Sink for Kitchen Counter, Over S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8190ICA9OsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍽【The Premium Countertop Organizer Contains Dish holders】Over the sink dish drying rack contains these items: 1X dish rack, 1X knife rack, 1X vegetable basket, 1X cutting board rack, 1X detergent rack, 1X A cutlery rack, 5X hooks. All of these components can be adjusted or removed, so you can clean occasionally , wipe or arrange them according to your mood. For example: when the kitchen sink is between the two cabinets, the glass shelf should be hung in front of the top dish drying rack. 🍽【Perfect for Limited Counter Space Kitchens】Organization is critical to using space properly. Big and small kitchens always have issues with space. So using that space the best way is crucial. Over the dish drying rack can hold bowls, plates, cutleries, pans, vegetables, fruits, detergent, rags, etc. The water drops directly into the sink and won't wet the kitchen counter, help you to keep your kitchen tidy. It is a good solution if you want to save some counter space. 🍽【Long-Term Choice Kitchen Helper】Using the telescopic Tube design, you can adjust the length from 33 to 41 Inches without screws, it is more convenient for Kitchen storage. Perfectly fit most sizes of the sink, simply adjust as you need. A great choice for home, small apartments, condos, and dorms. Please measure it before buying. Another point, the dish drying shelf has a high-end, sophisticated appearance. Great gift for families, housewarming, Christmas Gift! 🍽【Drying faster & Sturdily Constructed Enough】Having this dish drying rack is convenient for as the dishes dry, the water all drips right into the sink. Saves your time as you don’t have to hand dry each item. The dish drying rack over sink can hold it all.The dish drying rack is made of high-quality stainless steel and a double L-shaped design structure. It does not bend under the weight and the suction feet help it keep in and gets rid of falling over. Max loading capacity: 80Lb. 🍽【Easy To Install & Happy To Serve You】The sink rack with tools and instructions can be installed without any other external tools,coming with screws & Allen key, the hole positions are accurate and It was very easy to assemble and can be adjusted as needed in order to fit your sink area. If you have any quality problems within 180days, please feel free to contact us. We provide return and unconditional refund services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8190ICA9OsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geanli","source_asin":"B097R92HLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097R92HLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097R92HLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
