window.products.push({"id":651631,"name":"FINDKING Ash Wood Magnetic Knife Strip, Magnet Utensil Holder for Wall, Refrigerator, Wooden Rack for Kitchen Knives, No Drill (Deep Grey, 16 Inches, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TMNuNLGyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGN FOCUS- The focus for the Findking magnetic knife strip is to offer a fresh and new way for our customers to proudly display their Findking knives. Designed and developed to fit in any home or kitchen space, the sleek design offers a very modern, professional, and organized aesthetic. As an extra feature, the handles are left exposed for easy removal and attachment for all your Findking chef knives. DIMENSIONS - Findking is proud to offer our magnetic knife strip in three different sizes to facilitate any level of “chef knife nut” (chef knife enthusiast). The “Large” strip is 46cm (about 18 inches). The “Medium” strip 40cm (about 16 inches) The “Small” strip 30cm (about 12 inches). The width is 6cm (2.3 inches) and will allow clearance to install under all overhead cabinets. The versatility of the magnetic knife strip dimensions makes it a great addition to any kitchen or home. SEAMLESS ASH WOOD CRFTED - The Findking magentic knife strip is constructed from Ash Wood. Ash Wood is known for its quality and rustic beauty. This wood is extremely durable and water and scratch resistant.Durability, versatility, and the rustic beauty will enable the Findking magnetic knife strip to perform flawlessly for years into the future. THE MAGNET - The magnet is strong enough to take the knife from you. Please be cautious when attaching a knife to the magnetic strip. When removing the knife simply grab the handle and pull down until completely releasing the knife from the magnetic strip. This magnetic knife strip will last for years, and always be a great grabbing aspect of your kitchen. INSTALLATION “OPTIONS” - The installation methods developed by the Findking design team allow for versatility and accuracy. The accuracy is provided by the drilling template and is important for keeping the magnetic strip level. The versatility is in the two different types of methods for properly securing your magnetic strip to any wall. The installation provides two different types of securing methods (3M tape or screws.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TMNuNLGyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINDKING","source_asin":"B0B87RLVM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87RLVM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87RLVM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
