window.products.push({"id":651693,"name":"Motorized Blackout Cordless Valance Blinds, Dark Grey Remote Control Wireless and Rechargeable Window Roller Shades with Similar Color Metal Valance, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zqGj40toL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"① DESCRIPTION: Remote control blackout roller shade with similar metal valance is made of 100% Polyester, with high quality lithium battery motor, noiseless & rechargeable. One USB cable included for charging. 6 hours of charging, running almost 6 months. It can not be connected to any smart device, ONLY by remote controlled. Time of opening and closing can not be set. There is slight color shading between metal valance and shade fabric because they are made by different material. ② MADE-TO-ORDER: We custom window shade width and height to make sure roller shades fit your window perfectly. Choose your unique custom roller shade as instruction on custom options. When you place order please leave your exact window width, height and other requirements, the shade can fit your window better if you can leave more accurate size, it will also expedite the delivery. If you are not confident with the size or color, please only order one blind for test. ③INSIDE MOUNT: Inside mount requires at least 2 inches frame depth, shade width should be at least 0.25\" less than the window inside width, shade height should be the same as the window inside height. For example, if your window inside are 35.5\"W by 40\"H, please choose WINDOW SIZE 35\"W , width fraction 1/2 and 42\"H to place order, we will reduce 0.25\" on the order width when making the shade, so the final shade you get will be 35.25\"W(from bracket to bracket, fabric will be 34.05\"W) by 42\"H. ④ OUTSIDE MOUNT: For better coverage, shade width should be 3\" to 6\" larger than the window outside width, shade height should be 5\" to 10\" larger than the window outside height. For example, if your window outside including frame are 35.5\" W by 40\" H, shade should at least be 39\" W by 45\" H, please choose width 39\"W and height 45\"H to place order, the size you ordered will be the final shade size, we will make NO deductions. ⑤ ATTENTION: Shade width is the total width including all bracket which takes up 0.6\" on each side, so the actual fabric width will be about 1.2\" smaller, it will let light come in from the top and both sides if you choose inside mount. Feel free to contact us if there is any question, we will do our best to make sure everything works perfectly. We can be reached in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zqGj40toL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yin Yang","source_asin":"B0C2HMP3TR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2HMP3TR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2HMP3TR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
