window.products.push({"id":651794,"name":"ECR4Kids 24 x 48\" Rectangular Resin Adjustable Activity Table, Spring Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b7gi-kqcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ideal for use in classrooms, playrooms, recreational centers, and at home, the ECR4Kids resin adjustable activity table provides a versatile and fun space for kids to work or play. The durable polyethylene tabletop resists fading, cracking, chipping, and peeling, and it cleans easily with a non-abrasive wet cloth. Table legs adjust in 1-inch increments from 13.25 to 22.25 inches high to accommodate growing children. ECR4Kids resin adjustable activity tables have achieved GREENGUARD [GOLD] Certification for low chemical emissions into indoor air during product usage. They are also CPSIA-compliant for safety. With a concentration on the Pre K-12 sector, ECR4Kids offers a wide range of products from tables, chairs and desks to cots, mats and a variety of storage cases in solid wood as well as scratch resistant double-sided laminate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b7gi-kqcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECR4Kids","source_asin":"B00AZMA3RI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AZMA3RI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AZMA3RI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
