window.products.push({"id":651881,"name":"Jchornor Wooden Digital Alarm Clock, 2.5-inch Small Mini Modern Cube Desk Wood Alarm Clock with 3 Alarm, Time Date Temperature LED Display for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sfGzNKBqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you find that the display screen goes off after a period of time, please note that the clock is not broken, it is turned on the voice control mode.【Safety Upgrade Modern Cube Clock】Dimension: 2.55 x 2.55x 2.55 inches, bamboo color. This wood alarm clock is small, cute and easy to carry. Round corner design without the sharp corner, feel smooth and texture, it will help to protect your family to avoid being scratched especially for the kids. 【3 Alarm Setting】This led wooden alarm clock allows you to set 3 groups of alarm time, wake you up in the morning or remind you of important appointments. You can set 3 groups of small digital clock to achieve the snooze function or set different time of wood clock for yourself and your family member. Not just a wooden clock with time, date, temperature display, is your room/bedroom's high-end decoration. 【Adjustable Brightness】The wood grain alarm clock has 4 kinds of adjustable brightness, which can meet your brightness needs well. No matter it is day or night, you can adjust the wooden digital alarm clock according to your own habits. Press the 'UP' key for 3 seconds to enter the setting item. Display “L3”, Press up and down key to switch the 4 brightness--L0-L1-L2-L3. 【Multi-functional】The cube alarm clock has 2 display modes, which can meet your different needs. Press 'SET' key to transform DP1←→DP2 Mode. dp-1 mode: The screen will display Date/Time/Temperature in turn. dp-2 mode: Only show time. Stylish appearance and multiple functions make wood digital clock suitable as a gifts for kids/friends. 【Flexible Power Supply】Support the use of usb cable to plug in or 3*AAA batteries for this small clock. If using batteries, it is strongly recommended to turn on the sound control mode, otherwise it will run out quickly. If you have any other questions, please feel free to contact us by email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sfGzNKBqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JCHORNOR","source_asin":"B0978XJPVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-651881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0978XJPVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0978XJPVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
